type: software
title: OSSFlow
version: 1.5.3
date-released: 2026-10-30
license: GPL-3.0-only
url: https://ossflow.xyz
repository-code: https://github.com/w6liam/OSSFlow
abstract: >-
  OSSFlow is a free, open-source voice dictation app for Android 14 and newer.
  A floating bubble pastes cleaned speech into the app you are using. You bring
  your own API key for Grok speech-to-text or any OpenAI-compatible
  transcription API.
authors:
